                 When is the last day to register to vote in order to be eligible to vote for an election? 
                 
             
         
         
             
                The last day to register to vote for an election is 10 days before the date of the election. The Town Clerk’s office will be open until 8 pm  You many register to vote as long as you will turn 18 years of age on or prior to the date of the election.
             
         


         
             
                 What hours are the polls are open? 
                 
             
         
         
             
                For the Town Election the polls are open at 7 am and close at 8 pm in the evening. For all State Election the polls will open at 7 am in the morning and close at 8 pm in the evening.  Anyone in line when the polls close will be able to vote.
             
         


         
             
